    "title": "AIS transactional domain events",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "At-least-once authenticated HTTP delivery. Deduplicate source/id, retain tenant scope and schema version. No broker is required. Unlisted legacy payloads remain envelope-only. No production server is implied."
